  Source: check
  Severity: DiagnosticSeverity_Error
  Code: <none>
  Message:
    `monthly_rent` is a field of `Tenant` only.
    But `s` could also be `Agent`, which has no `monthly_rent`.

    The clauses above this one already match `Landlord`,
    so `Agent` is what is left to reach here.

    Narrow `s` first:

      EVERY Tenant s …
      CONSIDER s WHEN Tenant t THEN … s's monthly_rent …

    (or just `THEN t` when the field is the whole payload), or put the read
    under an `OTHERWISE` after the other arms — or declare `monthly_rent` on
    `Agent` too.

