  Code: <none>
  Message:
    `monthly_rent` is a field of `Tenant` only.
    But whatever it is applied to could also be `Landlord` or `Agent`, which have no `monthly_rent`.

    There is no base here to narrow: a selector used as a value has nothing
    to be narrowed by, so every constructor of `Actor` can reach
    this read.

    Read the field through a name you have narrowed instead:

      GIVEN x YIELD CONSIDER x WHEN Tenant t THEN t OTHERWISE …

    or declare `monthly_rent` on `Landlord` or `Agent` too.

